sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as User / API Client
    participant Route as OpenShift Route<br/>80/TCP HTTP
    participant Service as TrustyAI Service<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant Core as explainability-core
    participant Storage as Storage Backend<br/>PVC / MinIO / MariaDB
    participant InfServer as KServe / ModelMesh<br/>Inference Server
    participant Prom as Prometheus

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over Client,Storage: Flow 1: ModelMesh Inference Payload Ingestion
        Client->>Route: POST /consumer/kserve/v2<br/>ModelMesh inference payload
        Route->>Service: Forward (port 8080)
        Service->>Service: ModelMeshInferencePayloadReconciler<br/>Match partial payloads (input+output)
        Service->>Storage: Store reconciled inference record
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 230)
        Note over Client,Storage: Flow 2: KServe CloudEvent Ingestion
        InfServer->>Service: CloudEvent<br/>org.kubeflow.serving.inference.request
        InfServer->>Service: CloudEvent<br/>org.kubeflow.serving.inference.response
        Service->>Service: KServeInferencePayloadReconciler<br/>Match request/response pairs
        Service->>Storage: Store reconciled inference record
    end

    rect rgb(230, 255, 230)
        Note over Service,Prom: Flow 3: Scheduled Metric Computation
        Service->>Service: PrometheusScheduler triggers (every 5s)
        Service->>Storage: Read inference data (batch_size: 50000)
        Storage-->>Service: Inference records
        Service->>Core: Compute SPD, DIR, drift metrics
        Core-->>Service: Metric values
        Service->>Service: PrometheusPublisher updates Micrometer registry
        Prom->>Service: GET /q/metrics<br/>ServiceAccount token auth
        Service-->>Prom: Prometheus exposition format<br/>trustyai_spd, trustyai_dir, ...
    end

    rect rgb(255, 230, 255)
        Note over Client,InfServer: Flow 4: On-Demand Explainability (disabled in RHOAI)
        Client->>Route: POST /explainers/local/lime
        Route->>Service: Forward (port 8080)
        Service->>Storage: Retrieve model data
        Storage-->>Service: Training/inference data
        Service->>InfServer: Model inference call<br/>gRPC / HTTP
        InfServer-->>Service: Prediction result
        Service->>Core: Compute LIME explanation
        Core-->>Service: Feature saliency scores
        Service-->>Route: JSON explanation response
        Route-->>Client: Explanation result
    end
